    (arity 2 2)
    (semantics "Arguments operation,width: pop b then a from typed operand stack, push width-bit modular a op b. add/sub/mul/and/or/xor wrap; shl/shr_s/shr_u mask b by width-1; rotates mask count and rotate width bits. Validation requires two operands of the stated type; stack underflow/type mismatch is invalid code, not a runtime trap."))
